# Neon -- loud, and unrepentant about it
#
# The bold one. Purple-black ground, saturation pushed hard, and the
# lightness floor raised so nothing sinks into the background. Every
# family keeps its place -- it is just all turned up.

name    Neon
blurb   Hot pink, cold cyan, and a purple night.

# --- interface roles -------------------------------------------------------
